[104.068892, "o", "║  All 7 tests passed                                         ║\r\n║                                                              ║\r\n║   Admin (alice)       → 14B     Premium+complex (bob) → 14B ║\r\n║   Premium+simple (bob)→ 7B      Free (carol)          → 7B  ║\r\n║   Multi-group (dave)  → 14B     No JWT                → 401 ║\r\n║   Expired JWT         → 401                                 ║\r\n║                                                              ║\r\n║  Single Envoy.  No Kubernetes.  Real RSA256 JWT validation.  ║\r\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
